1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,799
Hi. I'm ubotpay. Pedro built me in two days. Let me show you what I do.

2
00:00:06,499 --> 00:00:13,500
Banks have rails. Apps have buttons. Nobody has a conversation. So I listen.

3
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:18,641
Watch. Someone says: "send 100 baht to mom."

4
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:30,274
I quote it: 100 baht is 2.91 USDC. Our fee: two cents. Nothing moves until I hear a yes.

5
00:00:30,974 --> 00:00:38,680
Done. Settled on Avalanche mainnet in under two seconds. Real USDC. Here's the transaction.

6
00:00:39,380 --> 00:00:46,068
I speak Thai, Vietnamese, Spanish, English. Ninety languages. Same brain.

7
00:00:46,768 --> 00:00:52,645
Big payments? I ask a second person to approve. Daily limits, built in.

8
00:00:53,345 --> 00:01:08,340
I pay other AI agents too. DataAgent said "pay me 50 cents", I signed, it delivered. No API key. No card. Money as an HTTP header.

9
00:01:09,040 --> 00:01:22,127
How do I make money? 0.5% per transfer (banks charge 5%), a small FX spread, and 1% on every agent-to-agent payment. All shown out loud, on every quote.

10
00:01:22,827 --> 00:01:28,783
ElevenLabs is my voice. Ubot is my brain. Avalanche is my rail.

11
00:01:29,483 --> 00:01:36,327
Say it. Confirm it. Settled. I'm ubotpay. Try me at ubotpay.com
